# A8 Tiger Fitness: Gym Website

> Stronger People. Happier Lives.

A modern, responsive one-page website for **A8 Tiger Fitness**, a premium gym in Santacruz East, Mumbai. It is built with plain **HTML, CSS and JavaScript**: no frameworks, no build step and no install. Open `index.html` and it runs.

![A8 Tiger Fitness: desktop preview](docs/preview-desktop.jpg)

---

## ✨ Features

- **Liquid glass menu.** A glassy navigation bar with a lime water drop that slides, stretches and splits as you move between sections (WebGL, with a CSS fallback). The drop follows you as you scroll, and every menu icon has its own small animation.
- **Polaroid photo gallery.** The gym photos hang like instant prints pegged to a string. You can drag the string, click a print, use the arrows or press ← / →, and the prints swing with real spring physics. It also plays on its own.
- **Hero section.** A bold "Train Hard. Train Smart." headline, feature highlights and a Join Now call to action.
- **Facilities.** 11 facilities with icons: TRX, Kickboxing, Power Yoga, Yoga, Spinning, Matt Pilates, Cardio, Functional, Zumba, Steam and Shower.
- **Why choose A8.** Cards for the equipment, the cardio and strength area, the turf zone, the studio room and the ambience.
- **Pre-sale offer.** A resident-discount banner for annual memberships.
- **Contact.** Phone numbers, address and a "Visit us today" block.
- **Fully responsive.** It works on desktop, tablet and mobile. On phones the menu becomes an icon bar.
- **Fast and offline-ready.** Fonts and images are self-hosted, with no external CDN.
- **Accessible.** It has keyboard navigation, ARIA labels and respects reduced motion.

