## 🛠️ Customising

- **Gallery photos:** edit the `slides` list in `script.js`. Add a photo to `assets/gallery/` and add `{ image, title, caption }`.
- **Menu items:** edit `navItems` in `script.js`.
- **Colours:** change the variables under `:root` in `styles.css`. The theme block is at the end of the file.
- **Contact details:** edit the contact section in `index.html`.

### Using React?

The `react-version/` folder has the menu and gallery as React + TypeScript components for a Next.js project with Tailwind and shadcn/ui. See [`react-version/README.md`](react-version/README.md).

